.TH startlxde 1 "Mar 21, 2008" "startlxde"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
startlxde \- X session script to prepare environment and run lxsession.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B startlxde
.br

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBstartlxde\fP is used to start the desktop session of LXDE.
By default it loads openbox, lxpanel, pcmanfm, dbus-launch, and lxsession.

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Hong Jen Yee <pcman.tw@gmail.com>
